<body>
<div class="wrap">
  <h1>BILLIARDS</h1>
  <div class="info">
    <b>How to shoot:</b> Press and hold the mouse on the white <b>cue ball</b>,
    drag the mouse <b>backward</b> to aim (the line shows the direction of the shot),
    then release to strike. A longer drag means a harder shot.
    Click <b>Reset</b> to re-rack the table.
  </div>
